  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "Closing this. Since it was written, #33949 moved the cuda_ipc pool onto the CUDA driver calls `cuStreamWaitValue32` and `cuStreamWriteValue32`, so opening the gate on ROCm would turn on a path that cannot work there. Doing this properly needs HIP versions of those calls and a fresh measurement on AMD hardware.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-18T03:47:37Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/33747#issuecomment-6245337523",
      "id": 6245337523,
      "updated_at": "2026-10-18T03:47:37Z",
      "user": {
        "login": "vincentzed"
      }
    },
    {
      "body": "Reopening, I closed this too early. The change is still wanted, but it needs testing on AMD before it can merge. Since this was written, #33949 moved the cuda_ipc pool onto `cuStreamWaitValue32` and `cuStreamWriteValue32`, so ROCm needs the HIP equivalents (`hipStreamWaitValue32` and `hipStreamWriteValue32`) checked on real hardware. The MI325X numbers in the description are from before that change.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-18T03:49:03Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/33747#issuecomment-6245348434",
      "id": 6245348434,
      "updated_at": "2026-10-18T03:49:03Z",
      "user": {
        "login": "vincentzed"
      }
    }
